@startuml sandbox-to-b2b-flow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
}

title Solveur Magique (V1.0.0) — nLPD-Compliant Sandbox-to-B2B Conversion Flow

actor "Team Manager\n(Claire)" as Manager
participant "Web App\n(Zero-PII Sandbox)" as Web
participant "FastAPI Backend\n(Swiss Cloud)" as API
participant "Export & PDF\nGenerator" as PDF
actor "Institution Director\n(Marc)" as Director
participant "Billing\n(Stripe CH / QR-Bill)" as Billing

== Phase 1: Risk-Free Bottom-Up Trial (Zero PII) ==
Manager -> Web : Click "Start Anonymous Sandbox"
Web -> API : POST /sandbox/sessions (No real names, no card)
API --> Web : Ephemeral workspace + nLPD pseudonym banner
Manager -> Web : Configure real shift codes (MC1, SDE), pensums\nas "Staff A / B / C" & run CP-SAT solve
Web -> API : POST /schedules/{id}/solve
API --> Web : Optimized grid + conflict demo (5s cap)
note over Manager, API
  No identifiable natural persons -> Zero nLPD exposure
  during evaluation; manager validates ROI in < 10 minutes.
end note

== Phase 2: One-Click Institutional Conversion ("Pack Direction") ==
Manager -> Web : Click "Request Institutional Funding"
Web -> API : POST /pack-direction (team_size, current_hours_per_week)
API -> PDF : Render 2-page Pack Direction PDF\n(ROI Estimate + Pre-Signed nLPD Art. 9 DPA +\nInfomaniak Swiss ISO 27001 Attestation)
PDF --> Web : Pack_Direction_SolveurMagique.pdf
Web --> Manager : Download PDF dossier
Manager -> Director : Forward Pack Direction for budget sign-off

== Phase 3: Top-Down B2B Approval & Tenant Activation ==
Director -> Web : Open upgrade link & select flat tier\n(Starter CHF 39 / Pro CHF 69 / Business CHF 129)
Director -> Web : Countersign nLPD DPA digitally

alt Self-Serve Card / TWINT (Starter / Pro / SME)
  Web -> Billing : Redirect to Stripe Switzerland Checkout (CHF)
  Billing --> API : Webhook: checkout.session.completed
else Institutional Annual Invoice (Business / Foundation)
  API -> Billing : Generate ISO 20022 Swiss QR-Bill PDF
  Billing --> Director : Deliver QR-Invoice (30-day payment term)
  Director -> Billing : Pay via Swiss e-banking
  Billing --> API : Payment reconciled (Operator / Camt.054)
end

API -> API : Promote Sandbox templates to Named Multi-Tenant Org\nEnable PostgreSQL RLS + Tier Quotas + DPA Audit Record
API --> Director : Subscription active + Invoice archive
API --> Manager : Workspace unlocked (real names enabled, full Excel/CSV export)

@enduml
